WEBVTT

00:00:01.834 --> 00:00:09.016
Candy couldn't root for Anthony
who was in the rodeo competition.

00:00:09.955 --> 00:00:16.693
Not caring whether Anthony would win or lose,
Candy only prayed that he wouldn't get hurt.

00:00:16.871 --> 00:00:19.928
And then, Anthony won.

00:00:20.124 --> 00:00:26.425
The first date.

00:00:33.910 --> 00:00:39.444
Anthony!
Do your best!

00:00:41.102 --> 00:00:43.313
Go, Anthony...!

00:00:44.622 --> 00:00:47.226
Kurin! Sorry if I woke you up!

00:00:47.514 --> 00:00:51.308
I had a dream that I was
at the rodeo.

00:00:55.099 --> 00:00:56.823
What happened!?

00:01:02.833 --> 00:01:04.567
Fire!

00:01:04.942 --> 00:01:06.737
Mr. Stear, are you okay?

00:01:08.263 --> 00:01:09.205
Stear!

00:01:11.031 --> 00:01:12.520
What happened, Stear?

00:01:12.969 --> 00:01:15.238
Today's experiment... failed.

00:01:15.273 --> 00:01:17.063
Just what kind of experiment was that?

00:01:18.003 --> 00:01:19.144
Fireworks.

00:01:23.055 --> 00:01:24.145
Fireworks!?

00:01:24.366 --> 00:01:27.063
Why were you making those
things during the night?!

00:01:27.464 --> 00:01:33.109
Since Anthony won in the rodeo, I wanted
to make fireworks for him.

00:01:33.696 --> 00:01:35.856
Stear, you did that for a friend...

00:01:36.680 --> 00:01:38.537
You're not going to hold a celebration!

00:01:38.834 --> 00:01:41.852
Forget about the rodeo,
like it never happened!

00:01:42.749 --> 00:01:46.810
But aunt, haven't you rooted for
Anthony as well?

00:01:47.693 --> 00:01:49.306
I played along with the circumstances.

00:01:50.676 --> 00:01:56.963
Anyway, this was the first time that an Adley
participated in an embarrassing rodeo competition!

00:01:57.276 --> 00:01:59.936
Why should I be ashamed of the rodeo?

00:02:00.103 --> 00:02:03.801
Anthony! Are you talking back to me?!

00:02:05.601 --> 00:02:06.449
Who is it?

00:02:07.358 --> 00:02:09.055
It sounds like a knock.

00:02:09.296 --> 00:02:10.372
Come in!

00:02:12.371 --> 00:02:14.116
Please enter!

00:02:14.928 --> 00:02:16.531
Who is it, so late at night?

00:02:20.991 --> 00:02:22.436
Anthony!

00:02:26.767 --> 00:02:27.649
Anthony!

00:02:29.935 --> 00:02:30.918
Welcome!

00:02:33.692 --> 00:02:34.837
Are you alright?

00:02:35.675 --> 00:02:38.337
You mustn't enter the house!

00:02:38.660 --> 00:02:41.827
The explosion must have scared
it away and it came running here.

00:02:42.278 --> 00:02:45.532
Anthony, why is this thing in the house?

00:02:45.702 --> 00:02:47.802
It's a prize from the rodeo.

00:02:48.394 --> 00:02:51.862
We hid it from you since we
were embarrassed...

00:02:51.897 --> 00:02:54.434
You shouldn't have made that explosion!

00:02:54.863 --> 00:02:56.189
Stop making fun of me!

00:02:56.655 --> 00:03:02.493
The Adley property is not a farm!
Get rid of it!

00:03:02.666 --> 00:03:04.002
You understand me?

00:03:07.162 --> 00:03:09.386
I didn't ask you for an opinion!

00:03:14.790 --> 00:03:15.939
Don't come close!

00:03:19.178 --> 00:03:20.513
Stop!

00:03:22.396 --> 00:03:24.675
Candy! Miss Candy!

00:03:26.994 --> 00:03:28.613
What are you doing, Huck?

00:03:29.955 --> 00:03:35.477
Madam told me to get rid of this calf,
but I hate animals and...

00:03:36.546 --> 00:03:39.542
Come on, you're a good boy.

00:03:40.583 --> 00:03:43.227
Huck, I'll take it somewhere
instead of you.

00:03:43.262 --> 00:03:44.969
-Miss, you will...?
-Yeah.

00:03:45.335 --> 00:03:46.177
Let's go!

00:03:49.661 --> 00:03:52.940
Miss Candy, be sure to
get rid of it!

00:03:59.618 --> 00:04:04.244
You don't need to worry. I'll take you
to Tom's herd where you'll be okay.

00:04:12.548 --> 00:04:14.290
Brother, look at this.

00:04:15.925 --> 00:04:17.361
Candy?

00:04:17.798 --> 00:04:21.559
Dressed like a hillbily again.
She's an embarrassment to the Adleys.

00:04:21.997 --> 00:04:23.574
Go to the Adley's.

00:04:25.818 --> 00:04:28.649
-Candy took the calf...?
-That's right, grand aunt!

00:04:28.684 --> 00:04:31.800
I was so embarrased that I hid
my face all the way till I got here!

00:04:31.888 --> 00:04:32.936
Me too!

00:04:33.372 --> 00:04:38.458
Damn it, this Candy...
If townspeople see her like that...

00:04:46.627 --> 00:04:49.188
This isn't good.
Tom is nowhere to be found.

00:04:49.223 --> 00:04:50.963
They must have went on to some
other place...

00:04:50.988 --> 00:04:52.573
Hey, Candy!

00:04:54.977 --> 00:04:56.209
Anthony!

00:04:58.104 --> 00:05:00.856
You still haven't found anyone
to give this calf to?

00:05:01.467 --> 00:05:04.695
No.
I haven't found any good places...

00:05:05.078 --> 00:05:09.448
I see. It would probably get dark by the
time you'd reach Tom's herd...

00:05:09.483 --> 00:05:11.458
Aren't there other ways?

00:05:13.117 --> 00:05:16.850
I guess we'll have to find a
new home for you by evening.

00:05:19.725 --> 00:05:24.055
What's the matter?
We're worrying so much about you!

00:05:26.003 --> 00:05:29.711
Candy, let's go to the town together
and find a new home for this calf.

00:05:30.499 --> 00:05:31.457
Let's do that!

00:06:04.391 --> 00:06:05.792
Would you like this calf?

00:06:05.953 --> 00:06:08.930
You'd really give it to me, miss?
I'd be glad to take it!

00:06:17.777 --> 00:06:19.392
Oh, no!
It's a butcher shop!

00:06:19.732 --> 00:06:22.570
Wait, mister!
Give it back!

00:06:24.414 --> 00:06:26.927
Hey! You promised, haven't you!

00:06:27.886 --> 00:06:32.333
Hear, hear! Take a spin on our cheerful
merry-go round!

00:06:32.334 --> 00:06:35.793
One round and your dreams will come true,
two rounds and your love will blossom!

00:06:38.234 --> 00:06:41.606
By the way, mister, would you like
to take this calf?

00:06:41.985 --> 00:06:43.330
What, a calf?

00:06:43.509 --> 00:06:47.433
You must be kidding! I do my business
with horses, I have no need for cows!

00:06:47.468 --> 00:06:48.680
Hey, Candy!

00:06:50.874 --> 00:06:52.368
Mr. Steve!

00:06:55.210 --> 00:06:57.817
So you came to town looking for Tom!

00:06:58.301 --> 00:07:00.336
I'll take this calf to him for you!

00:07:00.339 --> 00:07:01.837
Thank you!

00:07:02.254 --> 00:07:03.591
Thank you for your help.

00:07:04.441 --> 00:07:06.161
Send my regards to Tom.

00:07:07.101 --> 00:07:08.098
Hold on there!

00:07:08.815 --> 00:07:11.129
I can't just take this calf
from your hands for nothing.

00:07:11.335 --> 00:07:13.002
I'll pay you for it.

00:07:15.408 --> 00:07:17.264
But we don't really need money...

00:07:17.299 --> 00:07:18.920
That's right, mr. Steve!

00:07:19.134 --> 00:07:23.910
Candy, this calf may be a nuisance
to a rich lady like you,

00:07:24.348 --> 00:07:26.427
...but it's a valuable asset to me.

00:07:27.274 --> 00:07:30.209
I won't take the calf
unless you take the money.

00:07:31.045 --> 00:07:32.418
What should we do, Candy?

00:07:33.058 --> 00:07:35.102
I'll take the compensation!

00:07:36.282 --> 00:07:39.378
I see. It's a deal then!

00:07:42.457 --> 00:07:43.496
Thank you!

00:07:45.660 --> 00:07:47.965
Say "moo" to everybody for us!

00:07:48.000 --> 00:07:51.760
That's right!
You'll make many friends at the farm!

00:07:54.597 --> 00:07:56.154
See you again!

00:07:56.466 --> 00:07:57.789
Thank you!

00:07:59.814 --> 00:08:01.881
Goodbye, little calf!

00:08:02.638 --> 00:08:03.549
Goodbye!

00:08:06.464 --> 00:08:07.951
We earned money!

00:08:09.781 --> 00:08:12.436
Candy, do you know what
will you spend it for?

00:08:13.054 --> 00:08:15.165
Come to think of it,
I've never spent any money!

00:08:15.200 --> 00:08:16.122
Me too!

00:08:16.157 --> 00:08:18.910
I got everything I wanted
directly from aunt.

00:08:19.045 --> 00:08:23.888
Neither one of us ever spent any money...
I was too poor, while you were too rich!

00:08:26.786 --> 00:08:29.432
Candy, let's spend it together!

00:08:29.639 --> 00:08:30.748
Want to buy something?

00:08:30.783 --> 00:08:32.579
No, let's just spend it!

00:08:32.614 --> 00:08:34.140
How can you spend it,
unless you buy something?

00:08:34.175 --> 00:08:35.614
We could go there!

00:08:35.819 --> 00:08:39.324
That's right!
I never rode on it!

00:08:39.392 --> 00:08:40.361
Me neither!

00:08:43.572 --> 00:08:44.482
Mister?

00:08:45.049 --> 00:08:46.710
If it's about the calf, I'm busy.

00:08:46.745 --> 00:08:48.671
We'd like to ride!

00:08:49.069 --> 00:08:51.414
Really? I'll let you ride longer!

00:08:52.809 --> 00:08:54.631
Because you're my first customers today!

00:08:57.061 --> 00:08:57.822
Here.

00:08:58.865 --> 00:09:00.026
Wish for something!

00:09:00.318 --> 00:09:04.398
One round and your dreams will come true,
two rounds and your love will blossom!

00:09:04.623 --> 00:09:05.638
Two rounds!

00:09:06.472 --> 00:09:07.879
Okay! The flower of love!

00:09:08.772 --> 00:09:10.853
Oh... he meant...

00:09:18.423 --> 00:09:22.362
I wonder how happy the children
in Pony's home would be...

00:09:22.397 --> 00:09:24.375
...if they got to ride
on this wooden horse?

00:10:16.172 --> 00:10:19.310
Candy's heart was overwhelmed.

00:10:24.778 --> 00:10:31.109
Sister Pony, Sister Lane...
Is it okay to be this happy?

00:10:42.068 --> 00:10:44.760
*Denjin Anime Fansub*
This is a highly free fansub! With complimentary
dropped frames and fuzzy picture!

00:10:50.348 --> 00:10:55.932
Anthony was leading the calf,
together with Candy?!

00:10:56.958 --> 00:10:59.472
Townspeople have seen them
walking together.

00:10:59.747 --> 00:11:01.420
And what are they doing now?

00:11:01.784 --> 00:11:05.694
Uh... I've sent a servant to the town,
and he'll find them and bring them back.

00:11:05.890 --> 00:11:08.501
Find them and bring them back
as soon as possible!

00:11:08.877 --> 00:11:10.150
I understand.

00:11:13.483 --> 00:11:17.327
Ever since Candy arrived, the
Adley family has become such a mess...

00:11:20.024 --> 00:11:23.713
Madam Elroy will yell at me
if I don't find them soon...

00:11:25.253 --> 00:11:28.762
Anthony's horse!
They must be close by!

00:11:29.390 --> 00:11:32.210
Mr. Anthony!
Miss Candy!

00:11:33.968 --> 00:11:37.049
Anthony, I think the situation
is getting hairy...

00:11:39.309 --> 00:11:42.302
I won't let us get caught!
We still have some money left!

00:11:42.346 --> 00:11:46.013
Mr. Anthony!
Miss Candy!

00:11:47.671 --> 00:11:48.896
He saw us!

00:11:48.979 --> 00:11:50.318
Let's hide in that diner!

00:11:54.047 --> 00:11:56.985
Miss Candy!
Mr. Anthony!

00:12:02.920 --> 00:12:04.154
He went by.

00:12:04.451 --> 00:12:07.223
Hey, you two!
You can't play hide and seek in here!

00:12:07.667 --> 00:12:09.279
We're not playing!

00:12:09.707 --> 00:12:10.925
Are you customers?

00:12:11.302 --> 00:12:12.733
Yeah...

00:12:13.346 --> 00:12:16.071
If you're customers, then behave
and get on the other side of the counter!

00:12:18.305 --> 00:12:20.215
He didn't have to point like that...

00:12:21.301 --> 00:12:22.302
You said something?

00:12:22.643 --> 00:12:24.516
No, he was talking to me.

00:12:24.651 --> 00:12:26.984
Anthony, I'm hungry.

00:12:30.007 --> 00:12:32.114
Uh... aren't there any chairs?

00:12:32.642 --> 00:12:34.357
What? Chairs?

00:12:35.723 --> 00:12:38.459
Anthony, in this place,
people eat standing up.

00:12:38.679 --> 00:12:40.047
Two, please!

00:12:40.966 --> 00:12:43.170
I've never eaten while standing!

00:12:43.483 --> 00:12:44.166
There!

00:12:48.946 --> 00:12:49.650
Uh...

00:12:49.863 --> 00:12:51.279
Is there a problem?

00:12:51.582 --> 00:12:53.113
Can I have a knife and a fork?

00:12:53.427 --> 00:12:54.433
What?

00:12:57.224 --> 00:12:59.882
Hey, runt, are you making fun of me?

00:13:00.773 --> 00:13:02.466
Is that a way to treat customers?

00:13:03.042 --> 00:13:04.573
Wanna piece of this?

00:13:04.759 --> 00:13:05.689
Please stop!

00:13:06.246 --> 00:13:08.771
He's never eaten a hot dog before!

00:13:09.208 --> 00:13:11.196
Huh? So he's not an American?

00:13:11.626 --> 00:13:15.683
It's not that...
Anthony, you eat these with your hands.

00:13:16.015 --> 00:13:16.931
With my hands?

00:13:18.639 --> 00:13:19.856
It's tasty!

00:13:21.544 --> 00:13:24.790
Of course! My hot dogs are best in America!

00:13:28.590 --> 00:13:32.221
It's good! I've never eaten
something this good!

00:13:34.288 --> 00:13:36.133
What a weird customer...

00:13:45.749 --> 00:13:47.750
I think I've seen you somewhere...

00:13:47.864 --> 00:13:49.177
Mister, can I have another one?

00:13:50.813 --> 00:13:53.571
-That's right! You're that...
-He's not!

00:13:54.407 --> 00:13:55.202
Candy!

00:14:02.132 --> 00:14:05.193
-Mister, don't tell we're here!
-Uh...

00:14:06.440 --> 00:14:08.122
Could you spare a moment?

00:14:08.314 --> 00:14:13.821
Have you seen a 13 year old girl
and a 16 year old boy around here?

00:14:15.183 --> 00:14:18.495
A boy and a girl, huh...

00:14:21.402 --> 00:14:22.853
I dunno...

00:14:22.937 --> 00:14:25.844
I see. Anyway, thank you!

00:14:27.041 --> 00:14:28.366
Thank you, mister!

00:14:28.871 --> 00:14:33.324
Come on! I protected
you because you are brave!

00:14:35.584 --> 00:14:41.802
-Everyone, it's the guy who won in the rodeo!
-Really?

00:14:42.509 --> 00:14:45.344
Now, eat this! It's on the house!

00:14:46.262 --> 00:14:48.983
But we'd like to pay for it...

00:14:49.018 --> 00:14:51.473
-Come on, it's okay!
-The drinks are on me!

00:14:51.508 --> 00:14:53.238
You're the winner, after all!

00:14:55.935 --> 00:15:00.938
I'm so full.
Yeah... but we haven't spent anything.

00:15:00.973 --> 00:15:03.225
I don't think we'll be able
to spend it before the day is over...

00:15:03.260 --> 00:15:05.145
No, we'll spend it for sure!

00:15:05.268 --> 00:15:08.626
It's difficult to spend money
when you don't buy anything...

00:15:11.227 --> 00:15:13.122
Huh? What is that?

00:15:18.642 --> 00:15:20.380
Oh, it's a fortune teller.

00:15:20.982 --> 00:15:23.775
We can spend money there without
getting any goods in return!

00:15:49.459 --> 00:15:51.984
You've been through
many painful moments...

00:15:52.618 --> 00:15:53.899
Not too many!

00:15:58.848 --> 00:16:01.934
-But eventually, you'll become happy.
-Really?

00:16:02.502 --> 00:16:05.011
-I'm absolutely sure.
-That's great!

00:16:05.239 --> 00:16:08.263
-Anthony, it's your turn now!
-I don't care about this...

00:16:08.315 --> 00:16:10.202
-We still have some money left!
-I see!

00:16:10.412 --> 00:16:11.800
Read my fortune, then!

00:16:59.789 --> 00:17:01.109
Is something wrong?

00:17:02.617 --> 00:17:04.309
I'll have to do this again.

00:17:25.905 --> 00:17:27.569
This is impossible!

00:17:28.113 --> 00:17:29.405
What's the matter?

00:17:31.081 --> 00:17:33.599
Is something bad about to happen?

00:17:34.161 --> 00:17:37.518
Please tell us.
I'm not afraid of anything.

00:17:39.658 --> 00:17:43.371
Please, go home now without asking anything.

00:18:03.459 --> 00:18:07.409
That's stupid.
Candy, do you believe in such fortune telling?

00:18:08.503 --> 00:18:13.090
-But...
-I'm not the old Anthony anymore.

00:18:13.367 --> 00:18:16.357
Whatever happens, I'm not going to give up.

00:18:16.922 --> 00:18:18.141
That's right...

00:18:19.961 --> 00:18:20.988
Where do you want to go now?

00:18:21.269 --> 00:18:22.399
Somewhere high!

00:18:22.598 --> 00:18:23.748
Somewhere high?

00:18:23.956 --> 00:18:25.896
Just like when I was in Pony's home...

00:18:25.931 --> 00:18:28.901
Whenever something bad happened,
I would have climbed the big old tree...

00:18:28.936 --> 00:18:32.899
And then I'd allow the wind
to take away all unpleasant things...

00:18:34.029 --> 00:18:35.805
Okay, let's go!

00:18:41.016 --> 00:18:43.746
-Won't we get in trouble for this?
-It's okay!

00:18:52.686 --> 00:18:54.167
I can see everything!

00:18:54.936 --> 00:18:58.569
This is the highest building
in all of Lakewood.

00:18:59.683 --> 00:19:03.493
This wind...
It's taking away all unpleasant things.

00:19:03.871 --> 00:19:04.675
Candy!

00:19:10.793 --> 00:19:12.607
There's still some money left?

00:19:12.784 --> 00:19:14.031
Exactly two pieces.

00:19:14.241 --> 00:19:16.322
Take one of them, as a memento of this day.

00:19:16.398 --> 00:19:18.151
-Now, take one.
-Yes.

00:19:22.943 --> 00:19:24.288
A memento of this day...

00:19:30.207 --> 00:19:32.806
-Anthony, I understand!
-What?

00:19:36.747 --> 00:19:39.289
The bad thing... it was this bell!

00:19:39.528 --> 00:19:42.104
That's right! It really is bad!

00:19:45.128 --> 00:19:46.675
There's somebody up there!

00:19:54.508 --> 00:19:57.632
Mr. Anthony!
Miss Candy is together with him!

00:19:57.963 --> 00:20:00.903
Mister Anthony!
Miss Candy!

00:20:01.211 --> 00:20:04.279
-More bad things seem to be happening!
-Really!

00:20:13.243 --> 00:20:17.319
-Aunt is going to be mad...
-Are you afraid?

00:20:17.686 --> 00:20:21.521
Not at all! I feel refreshed!

00:20:21.921 --> 00:20:25.560
Me too. We had so much fun today.

00:20:32.469 --> 00:20:36.190
That's right. I've never had
as much fun as I had today.

00:20:41.376 --> 00:20:44.477
That's right. Candy was happy.

00:20:45.382 --> 00:20:50.167
She managed to spend a wonderful
day with her beloved Anthony.

00:20:59.051 --> 00:21:10.662
However, that black trump card instilled
ominous feelings in the corner of Candy's heart.

00:21:15.422 --> 00:21:19.725
To be continued...
